WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:02.983
(pop music)

00:00:02.983 --> 00:00:04.952
- [Narrator] Peace,
love and rock and roll.

00:00:04.952 --> 00:00:05.943
It's the hippie creed

00:00:05.943 --> 00:00:09.779
along with some flower
power and some crunchy granola.

00:00:09.779 --> 00:00:11.699
And we call hippies ‘crunchy granola’

00:00:11.699 --> 00:00:13.866
because of, well, granola.

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:20.888
The link between the people,
the culture and the granola,

00:00:20.888 --> 00:00:23.555
it started in 1969 at Woodstock.

00:00:25.354 --> 00:00:28.748
Organizers estimated that
200,000 fun-loving people

00:00:28.748 --> 00:00:31.589
would fill the small
town of Bethel, New York

00:00:31.589 --> 00:00:33.411
for the three-day historic festival.

00:00:33.411 --> 00:00:35.713
But the number of attending
doubled and the next thing

00:00:35.713 --> 00:00:39.792
they knew, there were over
400,000 people camping out,

00:00:39.792 --> 00:00:43.026
which led to shortages, food shortages,

00:00:43.026 --> 00:00:45.050
and well, that left the munchies-craving,

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:48.757
free-loving hippies a little hangry.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:52.171
This is where the savior,
Hugh Romney came in.

00:00:52.171 --> 00:00:54.513
Hugh and his commune, Hog Farm, were hired

00:00:54.513 --> 00:00:56.815
to help organizers run the festival.

00:00:56.815 --> 00:00:58.310
Upon seeing the food shortage,

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:00.070
they stepped in to help.

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:01.633
They rounded up a group of volunteers,

00:01:01.633 --> 00:01:03.553
hit the streets, and came back with,

00:01:03.553 --> 00:01:06.171
you guessed it, granola!

00:01:06.171 --> 00:01:09.110
Members of Hog Farm filled tons of cups,

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.068
and Hugh took the stage and announced

00:01:11.068 --> 00:01:14.735
there would be breakfast
in bed for 400,000.

00:01:16.193 --> 00:01:18.054
The hippies ate it up,

00:01:18.054 --> 00:01:20.230
and for many, it was
their first introduction

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:22.673
to the crunchy stuff,
and so there you have it,

00:01:22.673 --> 00:01:26.058
the original bond between
crunchy granola and hippies

00:01:26.058 --> 00:01:29.190
was formed by granola at the one and only

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:31.288
Woodstock Music Festival.

00:01:31.288 --> 00:01:33.705
(rock music)

